<title>USA: Jacobson Stores Inc Q1 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Jacobson Stores Inc Q1 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Mich. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thirteen Weeks Ended</p>
<p>							  Apr 26,   Apr 27,</p>
<p>							     1997	1996</p>
<p> Net sales					  $ 111,908 $ 106,525</p>
<p>Cost of merchandise sold, buying</p>
<p>   and occupancy expenses			  72,314    68,260</p>
<p> Selling, general, administrative expenses   33,800    34,436</p>
<p> Interest expense, net				2,448     2,272</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes		     3,346     1,557</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes			 1,171	 545</p>
<p> Net earnings					   2,175     1,012</p>
<p>Per common share:</p>
<p>    Primary and fully diluted			0.38	0.18</p>
<p>Average shares outstanding:</p>
<p>    Primary					     5,779     5,781</p>
<p>    Fully diluted				     6,782     6,840</p>
<p>		 (in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 results included sales from store closing promotions conducted at three under-performing stores closed in early March. Jacobson's operates 24 specialty stores in Michigan, Ohio, Indiana, Kentucky, Kansas and Florida.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
